#: lesson.yml:title
msgid "Setting Up and Analyzing Bias-Exchange Metadynamics Simulations"
msgstr "Bias-Exchange Metadynamics シミュレーションの設定と解析"

#: lesson.yml:description
msgid ""
"This tutorial offers a comprehensive protocol, complemented by practical "
"examples, for setting up and performing free energy analysis of bias-"
"exchange metadynamics simulations of cis-trans isomerization in a proline-"
"containing peptide."
msgstr ""
"Proline を含む Peptide の Cis-Trans Isomerization を対象に、Bias-Exchange "
"Metadynamics シミュレーションの設定と自由エネルギー解析を行うための包括的なプロトコルを、実例とともに紹介するチュートリアル。"
